5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Hello everyone. Since we are rearranging our workspace, I believe it is important to establish a rational foundation for our decisions. Let's start by identifying the most critical data we need to consider.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hi Victoria! I'm really curious to see how we can make the office a better place for everyone. I want to make sure everyone feels comfortable and happy in their new spots!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm looking forward to this! Let's make sure we don't just make a plan that looks good on paper. I want to know what our actual daily routine looks like before we move anything!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be realistic. A ""better place"" is a vague goal. If we want a layout that actually lasts, we need to look at the friction points and the hard data first. Let's see where we've failed before.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, hello... I agree that we should be careful. I think it's important to understand the costs and the actual impact of where we sit, so we don't regret it later.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Shunichi and Daisuke. To ensure we are making a sustainable decision, I will look into the ""Basis of the department's floor billing"" and the ""Facilities quote for re-running power and network.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to know how the room feels! I'll check the ""Sound meter readings across the room"" and the ""Physio's note from the workstation check"" to see how we can all be most comfortable.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check the ""Morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs"" and the ""Arrival times in the badge records""! I want to see how much time we're actually spending just getting settled every day.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll look into the ""Unplanned seat shuffles in the past year"" and the ""Drawn plan against the staff survey."" I want to see the actual grievances and how often our ""perfect"" plans have fallen apart.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look into the ""Two project strands within earshot last spring"" and ""What this year's two joiners reported."" I want to see how sitting near each other actually affects how we talk and work together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By dividing our research across financial, physical, and social dimensions, we can avoid redundancy and ensure no critical factor is overlooked. I look forward to seeing the results.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm so glad we're all helping each other! I think it's wonderful that we're looking at so many different things. I can't wait to see what everyone finds out!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, your energy is contagious! I'm just hoping we find some secrets about how to make our mornings smoother. Let's see if the data actually matches how we feel every day!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, ""secrets"" are usually just patterns we've been ignoring. I'm more interested in seeing if the staff survey reveals the things people are too polite to say to our faces. Let's see if the data is actually honest.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I hope the information is helpful... I'm a bit worried that we might overlook the social side of things, but I'm glad we're checking so many different perspectives. I'll do my best with the research.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I believe we have a solid approach. Let us proceed with our respective research and reconvene once the data is available. I will be particularly interested in how the financial constraints align with our goals.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go look into those things right now! I hope we find a way to make everyone feel really cozy and relaxed at their desks. See you all soon!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,May,,I'm on it! I'll go hunt for those clues about our morning habits. Let's see if we can find a way to save some precious time! See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be waiting. Let's see if the data reveals the actual cracks in our current system or if we're just polishing a flawed plan. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
