28,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll start my research now. I hope I can find something that helps us all get along better. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
